        "id": "kharazim",
        "name": "Kharazim"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "When laning, Rexxar is weak against Heroes who have a gap-closer to reach Rexxar behind Misha, damage to pressure Misha to death or kill Rexxar, and self-sustain to make good trades.\n\nIn team fights, Rexxar suffers from Heroes who can dive him and dodge his crowd control thanks to their high mobility (such as Zeratul)."
  },
