    "explanation": "Rexxar excels on Braxis Holdout and Dragon Shire because he can get a lot of value from having 2 bodies: Rexxar can safely take care of Minions while Misha stays on the Capture Point of the Objective.\n\nRexxar does well on Tomb of the Spider Queen because he can safely collect Gems with Misha and he cannot lose Gems when only Misha dies."
