    {
      "name": "Basic Attacks Build",
      "label": "Recommended",
      "description": "Rexxar's Basic Attacks Build is designed to improve both Rexxar and Misha, so that they can do better on their own but also work together to take down foes.\n\nThe additional crowd control provided by Aspect of the Beast or Crippling Talons at Level 7 helps both Rexxar and Misha to land more Basic Attacks on enemy Heroes so that you can get more value from Aspect of the Hawk at Level 13.\n\nChoose this Build when you can safely use Basic Attacks as Rexxar, when you need more damage for responding to the enemy dive, and/or when you want to increase the amount of peeling tools at your disposal, either to increase your own survivability or to help allied Heroes.",
